TAS / PTAS Board Surface
Role: visualize data/tas and data/ptas as status columns

⫻cmd/mode:Hybrid
⫻data/obj:
Parse living TAS/PTAS into ACTIVE / OPEN / COMPLETED / BLOCKED columns.

⫻data/tas:
B1 Read protocol.sectionBody("data/tas") and "data/ptas"
B2 Parse into task entries with id, title, status, kind
B3 Filter into four columns
B4 Surface gated / currentTasId / coherence / activeSteps

⫻data/ptas:
B1-purified: extract only well-formed step lines
B2-purified: status enum restricted to open|active|done|blocked|policy

